/origins/aeb97fb5-b324-4647-be38-6407f4939997?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=479564cf6d45ecdbc49151da5f79e309 2x, https://si.imgix.net/23c337ae/uploads/origins/aeb97fb5-b324-4647-be38-6407f4939997?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c023a72c5805cfc4293fae9bf104ae33 3x"}, "body": "Hello! Nice to meet you!\nI really love your artwork and would like to request art of my vampire character. He\u2019s an outgoing, clever and reckless guy who sometimes gets himself into trouble because of his reckless nature. He's good at fighting his way out of it though. He enjoys skateboarding and likes to hang out at the local skate park.\nHe hasn't been a vampire for long and is trying to get used to this new lifestyle even if it isn't always easy. \nHis hair is brown, his eyes are green and he\u2019s 186 cm tall. He has a lean but athletic build. \nI will leave pose, expression and composition to you. You can also change his clothing if you like, anything modern and trendy works very well for him. \nYou are also free to draw him with his cat if you like: https://i.ibb.co/31BZTJz/Mercury-Ref.png.\n\nThank you so much!\n\nhttps://i.ibb.co/PCCJ1g6/Benjamin-Ref.png", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ngumngim_/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2722328, "client_id": 187973, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bea9b029/uploads/origins/d7197871-cad2-4dcc-ba0b-586794219857?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a832aff02a7fbf77d9bd10577ec77aa6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bea9b029/uploads/origins/d7197871-cad2-4dcc-ba0b-586794219857?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a832aff02a7fbf77d9bd10577ec77aa6, https://si.imgix.net/bea9b029/uploads/origins/d7197871-cad2-4dcc-ba0b-586794219857?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61abaf18358127a5cc536de5462744bc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bea9b029/uploads/origins/d7197871-cad2-4dcc-ba0b-586794219857?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=142086cfbba0a591c0f69dddd262a5bb 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bea9b029/uploads/origins/d7197871-cad2-4dcc-ba0b-586794219857?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=44cd6e2c69cd1adda91d6160c8112903", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bea9b029/uploads/origins/d7197871-cad2-4dcc-ba0b-586794219857?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=44cd6e2c69cd1adda91d6160c8112903, https://si.imgix.net/bea9b029/uploads/origins/d7197871-cad2-4dcc-ba0b-586794219857?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b335cfad835f8c3c84f9f19265882832 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bea9b029/uploads/origins/d7197871-cad2-4dcc-ba0b-586794219857?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4f3203627066d3bef72a7720501e8847 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you! I like your art!\n\nCould you please draw an illustration of these characters? They are from a modern Call of Cthulhu (CoC) TRPG setting. They have a hero and villain dynamic.\n\nAlois\n180 cm. Blond male. Very skinny.\nHe has a talkative, mischievous, and sly personality. His usual expression is a big grin.\nHe is a member of an organization that fights supernatural threats.\nDespite the fact that Gabe is a villain, Alois is obsessed with him.\n\nGabe\n186 cm. Grey haired male. Muscular.\nHis usual expression is a smile. He has an irreverent and casual personality, but he is also secretly very dangerous.\nHe is the villain of the story.\n\nCould you please draw an illustration where they are sparring with each other?\nGabe is training Alois to fight. Gabe is confident and casual. Alois is determined to show off and look cool to Gabe so he is trying his best. However, Gabe can easily defeat Alois in a fight.\n\nEither way, thank you so much for reading this request!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1atjIzPqghGCslfuaHI8uE5rk5gzVuPSz", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": []}, "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 10000, "recorded_at": 1757819360.301457}]}, "from_archive": true, "custom": {"from_archive": true}}